                                (have) friends over for a barbecue on Sunday. Would you and your parents like to come?
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Item 4 -->
                        <div class="p-4 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 space-y-2">
